<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-ENGLAND 2 ITALY 0 - LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLAND 2 ITALY 0 - LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>NANTES, France 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>England led Italy 2-0 in their Tournoi de France soccer match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Ian Wright 26, Paul Scholes 43</p>
